WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.960 --> 01:32.900
=Episode 30=

01:33.140 --> 01:34.780
Your Majesty is merciful

01:35.020 --> 01:38.380
and forgives their deception.

01:38.979 --> 01:41.060
Yet General Fengyun,

01:41.259 --> 01:43.380
as military commander,

01:43.660 --> 01:46.060
deceived us all

01:46.100 --> 01:47.620
for personal reasons.

01:47.740 --> 01:50.420
It may

01:50.660 --> 01:52.180
disappoint the troops.

02:00.140 --> 02:01.060
Your Majesty.

02:01.060 --> 02:02.460
That makes sense.

02:02.780 --> 02:03.720
Moreover,

02:04.260 --> 02:06.220
Attendant Wu'an is a woman.

02:06.500 --> 02:08.380
Her presence in military camps
is inappropriate.

02:08.979 --> 02:10.740
If soldiers start

02:10.740 --> 02:11.700
following this example

02:12.300 --> 02:13.740
and hide women in camp,

02:14.420 --> 02:16.140
military order will be ruined.

02:16.900 --> 02:17.780
Your Majesty.

02:17.780 --> 02:19.300
Though I have personal motives,

02:19.579 --> 02:20.660
I'm not keeping a lover.

02:21.180 --> 02:22.540
I know He Yan's capabilities.

02:22.900 --> 02:23.740
After deliberation,

02:24.020 --> 02:25.220
I enlisted her in the army.

02:25.780 --> 02:27.100
She stayed in Yezhou Garrison

02:27.380 --> 02:28.860
after rigorous evaluations.

02:29.220 --> 02:30.300
Her current achievements

02:30.700 --> 02:31.780
are evident to all.

02:31.860 --> 02:33.220
As Commander of Yezhou Garrison,

02:33.420 --> 02:34.579
whether she passed tests

02:34.700 --> 02:35.940
or earned military merits

02:36.300 --> 02:37.660
was all under your authority.

02:38.780 --> 02:39.780
Miss Xu.

02:40.100 --> 02:41.030
Before His Majesty,

02:41.380 --> 02:42.460
mind your manners.

02:44.620 --> 02:45.770
Attendant Wu'an

02:45.940 --> 02:47.740
fought against Rida Muzi of Liehe tribe

02:48.020 --> 02:49.820
and killed Wutuo's general Huyate.

02:50.220 --> 02:52.180
She also helped lift the siege of Rundu.

02:52.579 --> 02:53.420
These accomplishments

02:53.460 --> 02:54.620
were witnessed by all.

02:55.740 --> 02:56.740
It can't be fabricated.

03:05.500 --> 03:06.500
Your Majesty.

03:06.740 --> 03:08.300
Miss Xu was wrong.

03:08.660 --> 03:09.780
I passed my evaluations

03:09.780 --> 03:10.660
and earned

03:10.660 --> 03:12.460
my military merits publicly

03:12.620 --> 03:14.220
in real combat.

03:14.500 --> 03:15.700
My comrades in Yezhou Garrison

03:15.940 --> 03:17.180
and buddies in Rundu

03:17.579 --> 03:18.860
can all vouch for me.

03:20.220 --> 03:22.660
Regarding the military order mentioned

03:22.820 --> 03:23.780
by Chancellor Xu...

03:24.980 --> 03:25.960
Your Majesty,

03:26.260 --> 03:28.100
though I'm a woman,

03:28.660 --> 03:30.380
I have aspirations to protect our nation

03:30.700 --> 03:32.220
and serve Your Majesty.

03:32.620 --> 03:34.660
Fortunately, I possess some skills

03:35.020 --> 03:36.980
and opportunities to fulfill my wish.

03:37.340 --> 03:38.280
Your Majesty.

03:38.980 --> 03:40.020
I firmly believe

03:40.780 --> 03:42.260
that one's virtue and capability

03:42.660 --> 03:44.300
shouldn't be judged

03:44.700 --> 03:45.700
by gender.

03:46.260 --> 03:47.180
Women

03:47.420 --> 03:48.980
with genuine talent

03:49.260 --> 03:50.140
deserve opportunities

03:50.260 --> 03:51.780
to serve Wei.

04:02.100 --> 04:02.980
Your Majesty.

04:02.980 --> 04:03.940
Soldiers follow rules.

04:04.180 --> 04:05.580
So do women.

04:05.780 --> 04:07.500
Attendant Wu'an eloped with a man.

04:07.620 --> 04:08.460
It's inappropriate

04:08.740 --> 04:10.220
and damages social morals.

04:10.500 --> 04:11.940
She is virtueless.

04:12.140 --> 04:13.380
No matter how capable she is,

04:13.500 --> 04:15.300
she doesn't deserve
to serve in the army.

04:15.740 --> 04:17.180
Mr. Wei is mistaken.

04:18.220 --> 04:19.140
Your Majesty.

04:19.140 --> 04:19.980
I

04:19.980 --> 04:21.740
never eloped with He Yan.

04:35.220 --> 04:36.180
I respect her,

04:36.940 --> 04:37.830
value her,

04:38.460 --> 04:39.740
and won't let anyone

04:40.220 --> 04:41.260
slander her.

04:48.380 --> 04:50.060
She graces my view,

04:50.860 --> 04:51.820
occupies my mind,

04:52.900 --> 04:53.900
and claims my heart.

04:59.980 --> 05:02.500
Well said. "My view, my mind,

05:03.300 --> 05:04.460
and my heart."

05:05.060 --> 05:06.460
I can't believe a straight man

05:06.540 --> 05:07.460
like you

05:07.460 --> 05:10.580
can be so affectionate.

05:13.300 --> 05:14.220
Empress.

05:14.500 --> 05:15.620
You are

05:16.060 --> 05:17.660
a paragon of virtue for all women.

05:18.220 --> 05:19.340
What's your judgment

05:19.540 --> 05:20.780
of Attendant Wu'an's virtue?

05:22.980 --> 05:24.300
Common soldiers are plentiful,

05:24.700 --> 05:25.980
but good generals are rare.

05:26.780 --> 05:28.380
Attendant Wu'an serves Wei

05:28.420 --> 05:29.580
and defends our territory.

05:29.740 --> 05:30.780
She's loyal to the nation.

05:30.980 --> 05:33.500
If we constrain her
with conventional rules

05:33.540 --> 05:34.620
for women,

05:35.060 --> 05:36.940
our nation will

05:37.180 --> 05:38.940
lose a brilliant soldier.

05:39.500 --> 05:41.659
Thus, I believe

05:41.860 --> 05:43.700
Attendant Wu'an
has committed no offense.

05:44.100 --> 05:45.700
On the contrary, she is meritorious.

05:48.020 --> 05:49.500
That makes sense.

05:49.940 --> 05:51.460
The Empress is from a military family.

05:51.659 --> 05:53.900
When I led the expedition years ago,

05:54.060 --> 05:56.300
she not only accompanied me,

05:56.540 --> 05:58.540
but also fought alongside me
on the battlefield.

05:58.980 --> 06:01.060
Attendant Wu'an
follows the Empress's example

06:01.140 --> 06:02.260
by serving in the army.

06:02.500 --> 06:04.300
That's a good thing for Wei.

06:05.900 --> 06:06.760
Attendant Wu'an.

06:06.860 --> 06:07.780
I think

06:07.780 --> 06:08.780
you deserve to

06:08.820 --> 06:09.820
be promoted.

06:09.830 --> 06:10.740
Therefore,

06:10.740 --> 06:12.220
I'll bestow upon you a marquis title.

06:12.540 --> 06:13.420
Starting today,

06:13.660 --> 06:14.630
you are

06:15.500 --> 06:16.740
Marquis Wu'an.

06:21.980 --> 06:24.340
Thank you so much, Your Majesty.

06:27.860 --> 06:29.860
Your Majesty is wise.

06:31.020 --> 06:34.740
- Your Majesty is wise.
- Your Majesty is wise.

06:47.700 --> 06:49.060
Who would have thought

06:49.100 --> 06:50.380
Attendant Wu'an was a woman?

06:50.460 --> 06:51.659
She's now Marquis Wu'an.

06:51.909 --> 06:52.820
I never expected

06:52.820 --> 06:54.060
that General Feihong

06:54.140 --> 06:55.300
would lose to a woman.

06:55.620 --> 06:56.740
It was humiliating.

06:59.560 --> 07:00.500
General.

07:00.500 --> 07:01.380
General.

07:01.860 --> 07:04.100
I lost because of my existing injuries

07:04.700 --> 07:06.300
that gave her the advantage.

07:06.980 --> 07:07.880
Of course.

07:16.010 --> 07:16.980
Let's go.

07:16.980 --> 07:17.830
Let's go.

07:23.820 --> 07:24.810
Commander.

07:24.980 --> 07:26.340
Did I embarrass you today?

07:27.580 --> 07:28.550
Absolutely not.

07:30.020 --> 07:30.980
You are...

07:30.980 --> 07:32.010
I am

07:32.700 --> 07:33.700
your view,

07:34.540 --> 07:35.420
your mind,

07:35.980 --> 07:36.970
and your heart.

07:56.260 --> 07:57.140
Why are you here?

07:57.659 --> 07:58.580
Why aren't you

07:58.700 --> 07:59.620
chasing after He Yan?

08:00.420 --> 08:01.480
Pingting.

08:01.900 --> 08:02.980
Don't be mad.

08:03.180 --> 08:04.060
Don't try to fool me.

08:04.260 --> 08:05.180
I saw it clearly.

08:07.500 --> 08:08.380
Chu Zhao,

08:08.380 --> 08:09.660
since you're with me,

08:09.660 --> 08:10.540
you can't

08:10.540 --> 08:11.530
like other women.

08:11.740 --> 08:13.180
I'm very possessive towards you.

08:13.580 --> 08:14.940
I'll never permit my husband

08:15.140 --> 08:16.300
to keep concubines.

08:16.580 --> 08:17.450
You misunderstand me.

08:17.620 --> 08:18.740
I've long suspected

08:18.740 --> 08:19.660
He Yan's gender.

08:19.740 --> 08:20.780
I planned to figure it out

08:20.780 --> 08:21.820
and then impeach Xiao Jue.

08:23.060 --> 08:24.040
Really?

08:24.820 --> 08:25.700
Of course.

08:26.540 --> 08:27.780
Then why

08:28.060 --> 08:29.420
didn't you speak for me?

08:29.540 --> 08:30.660
Instead, you defended her!

08:30.980 --> 08:31.860
Pingting.

08:31.860 --> 08:32.780
As an official,

08:32.980 --> 08:34.059
openly speaking for you

08:34.340 --> 08:35.260
would make it worse.

08:35.620 --> 08:37.100
His Majesty would grow suspicious,

08:37.700 --> 08:38.700
suspecting my motives

08:38.700 --> 08:39.940
and even Chancellor Xu.

08:40.419 --> 08:42.140
He might think the Chancellor sent you

08:42.320 --> 08:44.020
to deliberately target Xiao Jue
and He Yan

08:44.420 --> 08:45.300
to eliminate rivals.

08:47.140 --> 08:48.420
I see.

08:49.660 --> 08:50.900
I made a mistake

08:51.500 --> 08:52.860
and ruined your plan.

08:53.420 --> 08:54.620
You haven't ruined anything.

08:54.980 --> 08:56.060
I should thank you.

08:56.700 --> 08:58.180
Thank heavens

08:58.320 --> 08:59.300
you exposed it publicly.

08:59.620 --> 09:00.820
Had I blindly reported it

09:01.060 --> 09:02.580
to His Majesty,

09:03.220 --> 09:04.420
I'd be facing punishment now.

09:06.700 --> 09:07.590
By the way,

09:08.300 --> 09:09.300
how did you

09:09.300 --> 09:10.900
discover Attendant Wu'an

09:11.020 --> 09:12.100
is a woman?

09:13.500 --> 09:14.410
Come on.

09:20.620 --> 09:21.500
Because I

09:22.100 --> 09:23.500
saw the painting in your study.

09:25.660 --> 09:27.340
You won't blame me, right?

09:29.940 --> 09:30.900
How could I blame you?

09:31.620 --> 09:33.700
But based on a painting,

09:33.740 --> 09:34.700
you accused He Yan

09:34.740 --> 09:35.900
before His Majesty.

09:36.140 --> 09:37.100
That was risky.

09:37.900 --> 09:39.580
If Attendant Wu'an were a man,

09:39.880 --> 09:40.820
wouldn't you

09:40.820 --> 09:41.740
face punishment?

09:42.500 --> 09:43.460
Don't worry.

09:43.820 --> 09:45.460
I did that with complete certainty.

09:47.940 --> 09:48.860
Fine. I'll tell you.

09:50.540 --> 09:52.260
He Rufei told me

09:52.420 --> 09:53.450
that He Yan is a woman.

10:07.140 --> 10:08.100
So your plan

10:08.380 --> 10:09.380
was to challenge He Rufei

10:09.460 --> 10:10.500
publicly?

10:11.300 --> 10:12.170
Exactly.

10:12.460 --> 10:14.060
The valiant General Feihong

10:14.120 --> 10:15.060
couldn't even defeat

10:15.060 --> 10:16.340
a novice like Attendant Wu'an.

10:17.500 --> 10:18.340
The competition

10:18.660 --> 10:20.380
not only humiliated He Rufei,

10:20.820 --> 10:22.380
but also made His Majesty and officials

10:22.620 --> 10:23.620
grow suspicious.

10:24.300 --> 10:25.380
But today,

10:25.380 --> 10:26.380
it was truly perilous.

10:28.940 --> 10:29.800
Huaijin,

10:30.300 --> 10:31.180
thank you

10:31.660 --> 10:33.100
for telling His Majesty earlier

10:33.340 --> 10:34.980
that I am a woman.

10:35.260 --> 10:36.180
Otherwise,

10:36.180 --> 10:37.060
I'd be in trouble.

10:37.780 --> 10:38.740
Xu Pingting

10:39.180 --> 10:40.500
only met you once,

10:41.020 --> 10:42.580
yet she was certain in court

10:43.220 --> 10:44.540
that you're a woman.

10:45.420 --> 10:46.860
Someone must be behind this.

10:48.460 --> 10:49.420
Who else could it be

10:50.020 --> 10:51.020
besides He Rufei?

10:51.820 --> 10:53.140
But I heard Xu Jingfu

10:53.260 --> 10:55.060
dotes on Xu Pingting, his only daughter.

10:55.700 --> 10:56.740
He actually

10:56.780 --> 10:58.180
used Xu Pingting.

10:59.100 --> 11:00.220
He's in big trouble.

11:01.140 --> 11:02.060
Chancellor.

11:02.780 --> 11:04.540
This was all premeditated.

11:05.220 --> 11:06.500
She wanted to humiliate me

11:06.540 --> 11:07.980
in public.

11:08.260 --> 11:09.660
This is revenge!

11:10.260 --> 11:11.100
Chancellor.

11:11.100 --> 11:12.020
We can't just...

11:12.100 --> 11:13.780
Can't what?

11:16.740 --> 11:17.740
He Rufei,

11:18.220 --> 11:19.820
my daughter Pingting

11:19.980 --> 11:22.220
never pays attention to state affairs.

11:22.700 --> 11:23.820
How did she know

11:23.900 --> 11:25.420
He Yan is female?

11:29.580 --> 11:32.500
You used her.

11:33.260 --> 11:34.620
How dare you!

11:34.980 --> 11:35.900
Forgive me, Chancellor.

11:35.900 --> 11:36.780
I made a mistake.

11:37.060 --> 11:38.380
I only wanted His Majesty

11:38.460 --> 11:39.780
to punish them for deception,

11:39.980 --> 11:41.300
ruining His Majesty's trust.

11:41.540 --> 11:42.500
Then,

11:42.500 --> 11:43.340
we'll be safe.

11:43.380 --> 11:44.820
Why didn't you

11:44.860 --> 11:47.180
expose He Yan yourself?

11:50.620 --> 11:51.980
I've told you.

11:52.380 --> 11:55.820
We should make our decisions together.

11:56.900 --> 11:59.420
Seems I'm too old

11:59.900 --> 12:02.420
and I've lost my authority.

12:02.780 --> 12:05.220
Since you have your own plans,

12:05.780 --> 12:08.340
why should I work with you?

12:09.700 --> 12:10.600
Chancellor.

12:11.210 --> 12:12.060
Chancellor.

12:12.060 --> 12:12.940
I made a mistake.

12:12.940 --> 12:13.860
Forgive me, Chancellor.

12:13.860 --> 12:15.140
Don't abandon me.

12:15.500 --> 12:16.420
Should I help you?

12:17.260 --> 12:18.940
I told you to wait,

12:19.500 --> 12:21.900
yet you stirred up things.

12:22.620 --> 12:24.460
Now the entire court knows

12:24.580 --> 12:26.620
she's a woman.

12:26.740 --> 12:28.340
How could they not suspect?

12:28.540 --> 12:30.300
With endless rumors,

12:30.620 --> 12:32.660
if His Majesty

12:32.940 --> 12:34.340
orders an investigation,

12:34.660 --> 12:35.620
could your family

12:35.860 --> 12:37.500
be tough enough

12:37.620 --> 12:39.460
to endure an interrogation?

12:40.060 --> 12:41.100
He Rufei.

12:41.900 --> 12:43.700
It's not that I'm abandoning you.

12:44.220 --> 12:47.100
The point is you're hopelessly foolish!

13:06.700 --> 13:07.690
Yes.

13:07.980 --> 13:08.940
None of my family

13:09.740 --> 13:10.700
has any backbone.

13:11.860 --> 13:14.140
We won't withstand the interrogation.

13:15.580 --> 13:16.490
Chancellor Xu.

13:17.180 --> 13:18.420
In desperate circumstances,

13:19.460 --> 13:21.700
I'll choose to die together.

13:23.220 --> 13:24.500
If I suffer,

13:25.980 --> 13:28.740
you, the mastermind behind treason,

13:29.380 --> 13:31.220
will suffer too.

13:34.540 --> 13:37.180
Do you think

13:37.660 --> 13:40.260
anyone would believe a disloyal man
like you?

13:41.140 --> 13:42.900
Verbal claims mean nothing.

13:43.460 --> 13:44.500
But what if I reveal

13:45.220 --> 13:47.300
your correspondence with Wutuo?

13:52.780 --> 13:54.900
You actually deceived me

13:55.340 --> 13:58.140
and didn't burn those letters!

14:00.020 --> 14:00.900
Chancellor,

14:01.180 --> 14:02.980
I know my abilities are limited,

14:03.140 --> 14:04.780
and I am not

14:04.900 --> 14:05.940
as ruthless as you.

14:06.380 --> 14:07.370
Therefore,

14:08.020 --> 14:09.540
I have to keep something

14:10.140 --> 14:11.180
to protect myself.

14:20.460 --> 14:21.340
Fine.

14:22.540 --> 14:25.580
Young people always make mistakes.

14:25.980 --> 14:26.980
He Rufei.

14:27.340 --> 14:28.220
Pingting

14:29.180 --> 14:31.220
is my only daughter.

14:31.580 --> 14:33.500
If you use her

14:33.540 --> 14:35.180
again,

14:36.460 --> 14:38.980
I'll show no mercy.

14:39.940 --> 14:40.940
I'll never

14:41.060 --> 14:42.740
let it happen again.

14:45.020 --> 14:47.540
With current tensions high,

14:47.700 --> 14:49.620
you must stay composed.

14:50.340 --> 14:51.300
I need time

14:51.540 --> 14:53.300
to think about the remaining matters.

14:53.500 --> 14:54.900
Once I devise a plan,

14:55.180 --> 14:56.220
I'll let you know.

14:57.140 --> 14:58.090
Yes.

14:59.140 --> 15:00.980
As you command.

15:06.540 --> 15:07.460
Anyway,

15:07.940 --> 15:09.060
thank you.

15:09.900 --> 15:10.890
He Yan.

15:11.100 --> 15:12.100
From now on,

15:12.340 --> 15:13.300
I will

15:13.820 --> 15:15.300
deal with all your worries with you

15:16.180 --> 15:17.130
and trust you

15:17.580 --> 15:19.140
completely.

15:20.540 --> 15:21.510
Okay.

15:21.980 --> 15:22.860
It's a deal.

15:23.460 --> 15:24.340
A high five?

15:25.620 --> 15:26.760
Anyone watching might think

15:26.860 --> 15:28.020
we'd become sworn siblings.

15:39.060 --> 15:40.540
I didn't mean that.

15:42.300 --> 15:43.240
Xiao Jue.

15:43.980 --> 15:45.300
I've liked you for a long time.

15:47.260 --> 15:48.360
Now,

15:48.460 --> 15:49.340
I like you even more.

15:50.490 --> 15:52.070
♪I've seen the mountains♪

15:52.070 --> 15:53.610
♪And trodden through ice♪

15:53.610 --> 15:55.850
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

15:56.580 --> 15:58.090
♪Destiny is my creed♪

15:58.090 --> 15:59.660
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

15:59.660 --> 16:01.320
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

16:02.790 --> 16:04.300
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

16:04.300 --> 16:05.770
♪Gazing through the mire♪

16:05.770 --> 16:08.490
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

16:08.490 --> 16:10.120
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

16:11.610 --> 16:13.420
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

16:15.460 --> 16:18.500
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

16:18.500 --> 16:21.130
♪There must always be a longing♪

16:21.610 --> 16:26.600
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

16:27.020 --> 16:29.060
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

16:29.060 --> 16:32.810
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

16:33.220 --> 16:39.140
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

16:39.140 --> 16:40.010
Yan.

16:40.100 --> 16:41.780
When we heard news from the palace,

16:41.900 --> 16:42.860
we were terrified.

16:43.300 --> 16:44.860
We knew you were amazing,

16:45.220 --> 16:46.180
but never imagined

16:46.420 --> 16:47.420
that even General Feihong

16:47.620 --> 16:48.580
wasn't your match.

16:49.860 --> 16:50.700
Of course.

16:50.700 --> 16:52.300
I'm the top one of Yezhou Garrison.

16:55.060 --> 16:56.070
By the way, Miss Song,

16:56.300 --> 16:57.780
Mrs. Xiao mentioned

16:57.860 --> 16:58.980
that you just returned today

16:59.220 --> 17:00.540
and came here without going home.

17:00.860 --> 17:02.180
It's the Mid-Autumn Festival.

17:02.340 --> 17:03.660
You should celebrate with family.

17:03.940 --> 17:05.940
Are you facing difficulties?

17:06.310 --> 17:07.339
Yan.

17:07.339 --> 17:08.260
As you know,

17:08.460 --> 17:09.780
we ran away to avoid marriage.

17:10.119 --> 17:11.020
If we return home,

17:11.020 --> 17:12.460
how will we explain to our parents?

17:12.859 --> 17:14.579
Back then, you and Mr. Cheng decided

17:14.700 --> 17:16.180
to cancel your engagement.

17:16.619 --> 17:17.579
Now, it seems

17:17.859 --> 17:19.220
you're getting married.

17:20.220 --> 17:21.700
Who knows what he's thinking?

17:22.339 --> 17:23.980
He's usually so eloquent,

17:24.300 --> 17:26.060
but he avoids talking about marriage.

17:26.089 --> 17:26.940
He might as well

17:26.940 --> 17:27.859
marry his medical books

17:27.859 --> 17:28.740
for all I care!

17:29.420 --> 17:30.340
Enough of that.

17:30.340 --> 17:31.420
He's ruining our mood.

17:31.720 --> 17:32.710
Yan,

17:32.860 --> 17:33.980
when will you

17:34.020 --> 17:35.420
and Commander Xiao get married?

17:37.300 --> 17:38.500
Preparations should start.

17:38.860 --> 17:39.740
Six wedding rituals

17:39.740 --> 17:40.620
must be observed.

17:41.060 --> 17:42.260
Don't let Miss He be slighted.

17:42.740 --> 17:43.660
Mrs. Xiao.

17:44.180 --> 17:45.130
We

17:45.220 --> 17:46.660
haven't decided to get married yet.

17:47.100 --> 17:48.220
It's too early to prepare.

17:48.620 --> 17:49.620
It's not too early.

17:49.740 --> 17:51.220
There's so much to prepare.

17:51.340 --> 17:52.620
I think we're pressed for time.

17:53.180 --> 17:54.300
I never expected

17:54.540 --> 17:55.980
that the accomplished Marquis Wu'an

17:56.060 --> 17:57.020
would be a woman.

17:57.980 --> 17:59.220
This Huaijin.

17:59.700 --> 18:00.860
I know it's serious business,

18:01.100 --> 18:02.420
but he should've at least

18:02.580 --> 18:03.420
told us

18:03.460 --> 18:04.420
about the girl he likes.

18:05.260 --> 18:07.060
This is all I could prepare in time.

18:07.460 --> 18:08.900
Later, we'll go to shops

18:08.940 --> 18:10.260
to buy more stuff you prefer.

18:11.380 --> 18:12.220
These are

18:12.500 --> 18:14.500
all women's garments.

18:14.660 --> 18:16.340
Taotao told me everything about you.

18:16.820 --> 18:17.740
You've suffered a lot

18:17.860 --> 18:18.940
to become what you are.

18:19.380 --> 18:20.340
But after suffering

18:20.340 --> 18:21.320
comes happiness.

18:21.320 --> 18:22.260
Now,

18:22.260 --> 18:23.860
as the marquis appointed by His Majesty,

18:24.140 --> 18:25.380
you needn't wear men's clothes.

18:25.740 --> 18:26.900
Time to wear women's clothes.

18:27.050 --> 18:28.020
Exactly!

18:28.020 --> 18:29.580
We'll show everyone

18:29.780 --> 18:31.140
how brilliant you are

18:31.180 --> 18:32.380
as Marquis Wu'an.

18:32.700 --> 18:33.620
This will

18:33.620 --> 18:34.820
make all women proud.

18:42.060 --> 18:43.020
Brother.

18:43.560 --> 18:44.540
Why are you

18:44.540 --> 18:45.480
joining them?

18:46.180 --> 18:47.660
You kept such a huge secret,

18:47.860 --> 18:49.060
yet I'm the one being scolded?

18:49.390 --> 18:51.020
You brought that girl to your courtyard

18:51.060 --> 18:52.300
upon entering the city.

18:52.780 --> 18:54.300
You could be careless before,

18:54.620 --> 18:55.860
but continuing like this

18:56.260 --> 18:58.180
would show disrespect to Miss He.

19:21.480 --> 19:22.500
Commander Xiao,

19:22.500 --> 19:23.900
if you treat Yan poorly,

19:24.460 --> 19:25.700
though I can't fight you,

19:25.860 --> 19:27.620
I can poison you.

19:30.540 --> 19:31.660
The court banquet is formal.

19:32.100 --> 19:33.180
Let's relax and have

19:33.260 --> 19:34.260
a Mid-Autumn dinner.

19:35.900 --> 19:36.970
Under the full moon,

19:37.100 --> 19:38.220
let's celebrate with liquor.

19:54.180 --> 19:55.110
He Yan.

19:57.780 --> 19:58.660
Even carefree souls

19:59.660 --> 20:00.940
become restrained

20:02.340 --> 20:03.460
before their beloved.

20:05.620 --> 20:06.500
Really?

20:06.980 --> 20:07.980
Why do I feel

20:08.180 --> 20:09.620
you were quite bold back then?

20:13.420 --> 20:14.420
You never knew

20:15.220 --> 20:16.820
how nervous I was.

20:17.860 --> 20:19.220
Are you nervous now?

20:22.220 --> 20:23.420
You'll know later.

20:35.360 --> 20:38.090
(Chu Mansion)

20:43.020 --> 20:44.340
You don't have to watch lanterns

20:44.420 --> 20:45.380
with Miss Xu.

20:46.140 --> 20:47.700
Just make an excuse to decline.

20:49.580 --> 20:50.940
Given Pingting's temperament,

20:51.620 --> 20:53.340
if I don't say yes,

20:54.060 --> 20:55.300
she'll make a scene.

20:56.500 --> 20:57.820
The time isn't right yet

20:58.660 --> 21:00.020
to break with Chancellor Xu.

21:09.320 --> 21:10.340
He Rufei actually dared

21:10.380 --> 21:11.460
to use Xu Pingting.

21:12.180 --> 21:13.140
He will definitely

21:13.180 --> 21:14.250
rile Chancellor Xu.

21:14.700 --> 21:16.060
He won't have a good end.

21:20.580 --> 21:21.780
Finally, she no longer needs

21:21.820 --> 21:22.660
to hide her gender.

21:23.460 --> 21:24.820
Next, she will

21:26.020 --> 21:28.500
reclaim her status as General Feihong.

21:38.880 --> 21:40.720
Have the Chengs sent
the betrothal certificate?

21:41.020 --> 21:42.020
Not yet.

21:42.020 --> 21:42.980
But don't worry.

21:42.980 --> 21:43.860
After your pride

21:43.900 --> 21:44.820
was hurt that day,

21:45.060 --> 21:46.700
the Master and Madam were heartbroken.

21:46.700 --> 21:47.780
They won't allow the Chengs

21:47.780 --> 21:49.100
to waste your prime years.

21:49.340 --> 21:50.540
They confront the Chengs

21:50.540 --> 21:51.540
to cancel the betrothal.

21:52.140 --> 21:54.100
They should have arrived by now.

21:54.460 --> 21:55.540
My parents

21:56.780 --> 21:57.620
went to the Chengs'?

22:02.120 --> 22:03.020
Miss.

22:03.020 --> 22:04.220
Where are you going?

22:04.220 --> 22:09.670
(Cheng Mansion)

22:20.260 --> 22:21.180
To be honest,

22:21.780 --> 22:22.740
I truly

22:22.740 --> 22:23.860
like Taotao.

22:24.940 --> 22:26.020
It's just a pity

22:26.260 --> 22:28.740
that Lisu isn't fortunate enough
to marry her.

22:29.780 --> 22:31.540
Children have their own happiness.

22:32.120 --> 22:33.380
(Betrothal Certificate)

22:33.380 --> 22:34.700
Lisu's betrothal certificate.

22:35.020 --> 22:37.140
Today, we return it to your family.

22:37.860 --> 22:38.760
Mother.

22:40.980 --> 22:42.220
Mr. Cheng, Mrs. Cheng.

22:42.780 --> 22:43.620
Father, Mother.

22:46.060 --> 22:47.020
Well...

22:52.140 --> 22:53.030
Taotao.

22:53.620 --> 22:54.700
You want...

22:55.580 --> 22:56.420
Father.

22:56.420 --> 22:58.380
I'm having a headache.

22:58.540 --> 22:59.780
Could you feel my pulse?

23:00.070 --> 23:00.980
Let...

23:00.980 --> 23:01.900
Let me check for you.

23:04.260 --> 23:05.980
Your pulse shows good health.

23:06.540 --> 23:08.140
Just some liver heat imbalance.

23:08.580 --> 23:10.460
Taotao is a physician herself.

23:10.700 --> 23:12.460
- She knows she has a headache.
- No...

23:12.460 --> 23:14.260
Yet physicians can't treat themselves.

23:14.540 --> 23:15.700
That's why she came to you.

23:16.260 --> 23:17.140
Taotao.

23:17.140 --> 23:18.300
Your father misdiagnosed.

23:18.620 --> 23:19.540
Since you're unwell,

23:19.540 --> 23:21.020
you should return home to rest.

23:23.900 --> 23:24.900
See you.

23:25.100 --> 23:26.020
Let's go.

23:26.020 --> 23:26.980
Wait...

23:26.980 --> 23:28.060
I...

23:28.060 --> 23:29.260
With my years of experience,

23:29.620 --> 23:30.940
how could I misdiagnose?

23:32.020 --> 23:32.900
Song.

23:33.220 --> 23:35.060
Wrong diagnosis, period.

23:35.140 --> 23:36.220
Why so chatty?

23:36.580 --> 23:37.500
Exactly.

23:37.500 --> 23:38.700
Hurry back and rest.

23:39.180 --> 23:40.340
I won't keep you any longer.

23:45.540 --> 23:46.380
How is that possible?

23:54.020 --> 23:54.980
(Cheng Mansion)

23:54.980 --> 23:55.980
Careful.

23:58.740 --> 23:59.820
See?

23:59.900 --> 24:01.180
I told you she's not ill.

24:02.620 --> 24:04.500
Now I understand why Lisu and Taotao

24:04.620 --> 24:06.580
haven't been together yet.

24:06.980 --> 24:07.880
Why?

24:09.660 --> 24:10.700
Because of you.

24:11.860 --> 24:13.180
What do I have to do with that?

24:13.740 --> 24:15.220
Taotao is your own daughter,

24:15.300 --> 24:16.820
inheriting your stubbornness.

24:17.460 --> 24:18.900
Lisu is your disciple,

24:19.300 --> 24:20.660
learning your stubbornness.

24:21.700 --> 24:22.760
When stubbornness clashes,

24:22.980 --> 24:24.220
they both get hurt.

24:24.260 --> 24:25.140
I...

24:25.140 --> 24:26.060
Well...

24:26.740 --> 24:27.700
Wait...

24:27.700 --> 24:29.180
What kind of reasoning is that?

24:35.900 --> 24:36.820
Xu Jingfu

24:37.540 --> 24:39.060
didn't punish He Rufei.

24:39.900 --> 24:40.940
This shows

24:41.220 --> 24:42.300
He Rufei has something

24:42.740 --> 24:44.140
incriminating against Xu Jingfu.

24:44.740 --> 24:46.660
That's why Xu Jingfu feels threatened.

24:48.580 --> 24:49.500
But after this,

24:49.900 --> 24:50.950
mistrust will grow

24:51.180 --> 24:52.340
between them.

24:52.860 --> 24:54.180
We'll have them sawing off

24:54.420 --> 24:55.660
the branch they're sitting on.

24:56.220 --> 24:57.460
You seem to have a plan.

24:57.660 --> 24:58.700
How can I help?

24:59.020 --> 24:59.980
I'm meeting someone.

25:04.460 --> 25:05.380
Miss He.

25:05.660 --> 25:06.730
Commander Xiao.

25:06.860 --> 25:07.820
Mr. Chu.

25:07.820 --> 25:08.680
Please sit.

25:11.620 --> 25:12.620
Miss He.

25:12.740 --> 25:13.860
On the Mid-Autumn Festival,

25:13.860 --> 25:15.100
Miss Xu was certain

25:15.180 --> 25:16.140
that you were a woman

25:16.420 --> 25:17.450
because...

25:18.500 --> 25:20.100
Because I painted a portrait

25:20.580 --> 25:22.020
of you in women's clothing,

25:22.460 --> 25:23.420
and she saw it.

25:25.380 --> 25:26.280
Anyway,

25:26.780 --> 25:28.060
it's my fault.

25:28.580 --> 25:29.660
I apologize.

25:29.900 --> 25:30.780
Please forgive me.

25:32.060 --> 25:33.220
No need to apologize.

25:33.820 --> 25:35.980
Actually,

25:36.140 --> 25:37.100
He Rufei

25:37.700 --> 25:39.220
is the true mastermind.

25:40.020 --> 25:41.260
So, you knew too.

25:41.740 --> 25:42.980
To prevent further issues,

25:43.500 --> 25:44.380
I hope Mr. Chu

25:44.820 --> 25:46.140
will properly keep that painting.

25:46.900 --> 25:48.060
If inconvenient,

25:48.340 --> 25:49.580
I'll handle it.

25:53.020 --> 25:54.340
No need to trouble you.

25:56.860 --> 25:58.700
Since it's my portrait,

25:59.500 --> 26:00.540
I should

26:00.780 --> 26:02.020
keep it.

26:03.220 --> 26:04.300
By the way,

26:04.300 --> 26:05.500
congratulations, Miss He.

26:06.340 --> 26:08.060
You can finally stop pretending
to be a man

26:08.420 --> 26:10.140
and become a female marquise.

26:10.460 --> 26:11.540
One day,

26:11.540 --> 26:12.620
you will

26:12.860 --> 26:13.980
become a female general.

26:15.060 --> 26:16.300
I appreciate your kind words.

26:16.940 --> 26:17.830
In fact,

26:18.340 --> 26:19.780
I invited you here today

26:20.340 --> 26:21.540
because I have a request

26:21.980 --> 26:23.300
to ask of you.

26:29.380 --> 26:30.820
I won't help bad people.

26:31.860 --> 26:33.020
But regarding your request,

26:33.260 --> 26:34.700
I'm afraid I cannot help.

26:34.950 --> 26:35.940
After all,

26:35.940 --> 26:37.020
he's my mentor.

26:37.500 --> 26:38.380
I cannot

26:38.540 --> 26:39.940
betray my mentor.

26:41.820 --> 26:42.860
Mr. Chu,

26:43.140 --> 26:44.140
don't reject me at once.

26:44.700 --> 26:46.100
Let me share a story first.

26:58.340 --> 26:59.420
He Rufei and I

27:01.460 --> 27:03.140
are step-siblings, no blood relation.

27:05.830 --> 27:06.790
Back then,

27:07.060 --> 27:08.060
he was frail and sickly,

27:08.580 --> 27:09.580
living at Yuhua Temple.

27:10.460 --> 27:11.780
I took over his identity.

27:13.580 --> 27:14.700
That's my history

27:14.780 --> 27:15.700
with He Rufei.

27:16.740 --> 27:17.860
Now that I've returned,

27:19.540 --> 27:20.420
I will reclaim

27:20.460 --> 27:21.620
what belongs to me.

27:23.180 --> 27:24.260
Miss He...

27:24.500 --> 27:25.540
Mr. Chu,

27:25.540 --> 27:26.860
I'm not telling you this

27:27.620 --> 27:29.060
to seek your pity.

27:29.980 --> 27:30.980
I want you to understand

27:31.660 --> 27:32.860
how the mentor you revere

27:33.500 --> 27:34.900
resorts to ruthless means.

27:35.340 --> 27:36.620
To eliminate dissidents,

27:37.540 --> 27:38.700
he colluded with enemies

27:39.380 --> 27:40.780
and planned the Mingshui massacre.

27:41.940 --> 27:43.020
Not only that,

27:43.660 --> 27:44.980
to cover his crimes,

27:45.740 --> 27:47.380
he repeatedly conspired with Wutuo,

27:48.020 --> 27:48.900
plunging Huayuan,

27:49.420 --> 27:50.500
Rundu,

27:50.820 --> 27:51.850
and Jiyang

27:52.140 --> 27:53.140
into war.

27:53.660 --> 27:54.760
Now,

27:55.020 --> 27:56.540
he can sacrifice lives

27:57.060 --> 27:58.380
for personal gain.

27:59.140 --> 28:00.040
One day,

28:00.140 --> 28:01.540
he'll continue doing evil

28:02.100 --> 28:03.340
to satisfy his desires.

28:04.860 --> 28:05.860
Mr. Chu,

28:06.260 --> 28:07.340
you claim officials

28:07.340 --> 28:08.340
are helpless sometimes.

28:09.100 --> 28:10.300
But since you serve the court,

28:11.380 --> 28:13.460
shouldn't the nation come first?

28:14.980 --> 28:16.300
You said you go

28:16.940 --> 28:18.300
with the flow.

28:19.660 --> 28:20.860
But have you considered

28:22.380 --> 28:23.700
what kind of flow you go with?

28:26.980 --> 28:27.910
Therefore,

28:28.540 --> 28:29.460
I hope

28:30.100 --> 28:31.540
you will help.

28:46.260 --> 28:47.700
What's your next plan?

28:48.540 --> 28:49.620
Just let me know

28:50.220 --> 28:51.460
if there's anything I can do.

28:59.620 --> 29:00.660
He Rufei must possess

29:01.060 --> 29:02.500
evidence of Xu Jingfu's crimes.

29:03.580 --> 29:04.490
And the evidence

29:05.260 --> 29:06.180
is hidden in his house.

29:08.460 --> 29:09.620
I've been away for too long.

29:10.380 --> 29:11.780
It's time to return home.

29:12.620 --> 29:14.660
But that's only part of the plan.

29:15.500 --> 29:16.460
I need both your help

29:17.540 --> 29:18.740
with the rest.

29:25.980 --> 29:27.020
Congratulations.

29:27.020 --> 29:28.140
You'll achieve your goal.

29:30.620 --> 29:32.300
Chancellor Xu's power wanes.

29:33.220 --> 29:34.340
Exposing his misdeeds

29:35.300 --> 29:36.500
is already inevitable.

29:40.350 --> 29:45.700
(General Feihong's Mansion)

29:47.940 --> 29:48.820
(I'm back.)

29:49.820 --> 29:50.900
(General Feihong's Mansion)
(Times have changed.)

29:52.100 --> 29:53.180
(Things have changed.)

29:55.580 --> 29:57.100
(I once believed this was home.)

29:58.060 --> 29:59.060
(Yet it nearly)

29:59.060 --> 30:00.340
(became my burial ground.)

30:00.420 --> 30:01.860
(He Yan's true gender)

30:02.140 --> 30:03.500
(must never be revealed.)

30:04.500 --> 30:05.350
(Otherwise,)

30:05.700 --> 30:06.740
(you two)

30:06.740 --> 30:08.140
(will die without a proper grave.)

30:18.860 --> 30:19.980
Madam,

30:19.980 --> 30:20.860
since you're here,

30:20.860 --> 30:22.060
go and see Miss He.

30:23.020 --> 30:24.070
Watch your words.

30:24.620 --> 30:25.980
There is only the Young Master.

30:26.940 --> 30:27.980
The Young Lady...

30:32.180 --> 30:33.700
is recuperating at Yuhua Temple.

30:47.100 --> 30:48.180
(In this house,)

30:48.900 --> 30:49.860
(the only person)

30:50.540 --> 30:51.740
(I care about is my mother.)

30:53.660 --> 30:55.300
(I wanted to see her, but didn't dare.)

30:56.420 --> 30:57.510
(I wonder)

30:58.020 --> 30:59.300
(how she's doing now.)

31:12.460 --> 31:13.540
He Yan?

31:14.340 --> 31:15.340
She...

31:15.740 --> 31:17.780
She actually came here herself.

31:19.460 --> 31:20.380
Perfect timing.

31:20.900 --> 31:21.940
Let me see

31:22.260 --> 31:23.820
what she

31:23.940 --> 31:25.300
is up to.

31:30.750 --> 31:37.740
(General Feihong's Mansion)

31:45.060 --> 31:46.060
Seems like

31:46.540 --> 31:48.540
I really scared you badly.

31:49.620 --> 31:50.660
Brother.

31:51.300 --> 31:52.980
What brings you here,

31:54.060 --> 31:55.300
Marquis Wu'an?

31:55.540 --> 31:57.220
Is General Feihong too frightened

31:57.700 --> 31:59.340
to remember basic hospitality?

31:59.980 --> 32:00.900
Aren't you going

32:01.020 --> 32:02.700
to invite me in for tea?

32:06.340 --> 32:07.300
Look.

32:07.420 --> 32:08.500
I come bearing no sword.

32:18.180 --> 32:19.340
Please, Marquis Wu'an.

32:19.620 --> 32:20.980
You're our honored guest.

32:21.320 --> 32:22.420
(General Feihong's Mansion)
Please come in.

32:22.420 --> 32:23.380
Come in.

32:23.380 --> 32:24.390
Okay.

32:29.820 --> 32:34.500
(General Feihong's Mansion)

32:38.120 --> 32:45.030
(Not tempted by praise)

32:46.890 --> 32:47.820
Chancellor.

32:47.820 --> 32:49.140
General Fengyun Xiao Jue is here.

32:49.400 --> 32:50.340
(Not tempted by praise,
nor cowed by slander)

32:50.340 --> 32:51.380
Let him in.

32:51.580 --> 32:52.420
Yes.

33:06.380 --> 33:09.300
General Fengyun,
this is a real honor, having you visit.

33:09.860 --> 33:11.820
Forgive me for not welcoming you

33:12.420 --> 33:13.300
at the gate.

33:13.660 --> 33:14.740
I apologize.

33:15.140 --> 33:16.060
That's alright.

33:16.420 --> 33:17.460
Please sit.

33:18.700 --> 33:19.780
Tea for our guest.

33:23.500 --> 33:25.860
What brings you here

33:25.940 --> 33:27.260
today?

33:27.820 --> 33:28.980
I want to talk about He Rufei

33:30.500 --> 33:31.620
with you.

33:34.140 --> 33:35.460
He Rufei?

33:39.580 --> 33:40.500
General Xiao,

33:41.020 --> 33:42.980
you've come to the wrong person.

33:43.980 --> 33:46.500
I'm barely acquainted
with General Feihong.

33:46.660 --> 33:48.460
Nothing to talk about him.

33:53.460 --> 33:54.860
I heard

33:55.540 --> 33:57.660
you and he studied together

33:58.380 --> 34:01.380
in your youth.

34:01.820 --> 34:03.740
I think your connection

34:03.820 --> 34:06.540
runs deeper than mine with him.

34:07.060 --> 34:09.100
I'm familiar with General Feihong,

34:09.699 --> 34:11.020
but He Rufei

34:12.139 --> 34:13.980
is the real General Feihong?

34:16.860 --> 34:18.460
Your words puzzle me,

34:18.699 --> 34:21.620
General Xiao.

34:21.900 --> 34:22.760
Chancellor Xu,

34:24.380 --> 34:25.540
stop pretending not to know.

34:26.580 --> 34:28.219
He Rufei persuaded Chai Anxi

34:28.300 --> 34:30.300
to steal the Xiao Army's march map.

34:31.420 --> 34:33.020
Colluding with Wutuo forces.

34:33.620 --> 34:35.340
Suppressing my father's urgent missives.

34:35.580 --> 34:37.860
Leading to Xiao Army's defeat
at Mingshui.

34:39.980 --> 34:42.219
30,000 Xiao Army soldiers died.

34:43.060 --> 34:44.659
He Rufei harmed He Yan

34:45.130 --> 34:46.580
and pretended to be General Feihong.

34:47.260 --> 34:48.260
To cover the truth,

34:48.820 --> 34:50.580
he repeatedly tried to kill He Yan

34:50.580 --> 34:51.860
and got the Seven Tiger Generals

34:51.860 --> 34:53.020
killed in the Huayuan Battle

34:53.020 --> 34:54.219
as part

34:54.580 --> 34:56.380
of his deals with the Wutuo.

34:58.300 --> 35:00.060
He deliberately abandoned Rundu,

35:01.100 --> 35:02.780
leaving it besieged

35:03.860 --> 35:05.180
and nearly conquered.

35:07.140 --> 35:08.420
What a shock!

35:09.580 --> 35:10.540
That is

35:10.700 --> 35:12.340
outrageous!

35:13.060 --> 35:15.140
He Rufei's guilt is undeniable.

35:15.620 --> 35:16.520
However,

35:17.620 --> 35:19.340
he's merely a pawn

35:19.380 --> 35:20.740
in someone else's game.

35:21.460 --> 35:23.380
The real villain

35:25.900 --> 35:27.980
is the mastermind pulling the strings.

35:45.420 --> 35:46.340
This is

35:47.060 --> 35:49.180
the tea you've liked since childhood.

35:49.980 --> 35:51.380
Does it not suit your taste?

35:52.380 --> 35:53.260
No.

35:53.460 --> 35:54.860
I just fear poison.

35:57.620 --> 35:59.860
You tease me.

36:00.540 --> 36:01.510
Everyone, leave.

36:08.420 --> 36:09.500
How guilty

36:09.820 --> 36:11.260
you must be.

36:11.740 --> 36:13.140
Dismissing them like this.

36:13.380 --> 36:14.380
Shall we

36:14.460 --> 36:16.100
speak frankly?

36:19.340 --> 36:20.420
Let me guess.

36:20.980 --> 36:22.140
Both of you

36:22.540 --> 36:23.660
must have regretted.

36:24.420 --> 36:25.700
You regret

36:25.860 --> 36:27.780
not having killed me.

36:29.220 --> 36:30.220
But I promise you.

36:30.740 --> 36:31.820
Very soon,

36:32.340 --> 36:33.860
you'll be more regretful.

36:38.060 --> 36:38.920
Rufei.

36:39.740 --> 36:40.660
Don't think

36:41.380 --> 36:42.500
becoming Marquis Wu'an

36:42.540 --> 36:44.180
makes you invincible.

36:45.300 --> 36:46.940
I killed you once,

36:47.580 --> 36:49.820
and I can kill you again.

36:53.340 --> 36:55.500
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

36:55.600 --> 36:59.520
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

36:59.700 --> 37:01.640
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

37:01.730 --> 37:06.660
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

37:18.760 --> 37:20.170
♪I've seen the mountains♪

37:20.370 --> 37:21.780
♪And trodden through ice♪

37:22.050 --> 37:24.860
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

37:25.170 --> 37:26.560
♪Destiny is my creed♪

37:26.620 --> 37:28.020
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

37:28.170 --> 37:29.960
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

37:31.160 --> 37:32.630
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

37:32.800 --> 37:34.090
♪Gazing through the mire♪

37:34.270 --> 37:36.660
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

37:36.860 --> 37:38.910
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

37:40.040 --> 37:41.870
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

37:43.830 --> 37:46.750
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

37:46.840 --> 37:49.500
♪There must always be a longing♪

37:49.960 --> 37:55.020
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

37:55.350 --> 37:57.360
